PEX2                     = -0.1              $Variation of curvature Efx with load         
PEX3                     = -0.01             $Variation of curvature Efx with load squared         
PEX4                     = 0.1               $Factor in curvature Efx while driving         
PKX1                     = 53.8317777738557  $Longitudinal slip stiffness Kfx/Fz at Fznom         
PKX2                     = 36.8748219363584  $Variation of slip stiffness Kfx/Fz with load         
PKX3                     = -0.64168305066931 $Exponent in slip stiffness Kfx/Fz with load         
PHX1                     = 0.000347546231613 $Horizontal shift Shx at Fznom         
